  "contentHtml": "<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">벌써 더워지기&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">시작한 교실 ㅠㅠ </SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">아이들과 시원하게 한번 보세요~~~~~~~~`^^ </SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">어서와~ 남극은 처음이지? </SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/246CBC4D5381572923\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"754\" height=\"586\" style=\"WIDTH: 754px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 586px; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"해표인사.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_246CBC4D5381572923724A\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">세종기지에서 바라본 앞바다 풍경~ 세종기지로 온 물품을 옮기고 계시네요~ </SPAN></P>\r\n<P><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2273BF50538157191D\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"&Ccedil;&#1023;ª&Agrave;&yen;_polarmickey.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2273BF50538157191D1074\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">언제나 봐도 예쁜 블루 아이스~ 빙하</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/263CC1505381571932\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"718\" height=\"503\" style=\"WIDTH: 718px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 503px; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14_polarmickey.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_263CC15053815719329FD7\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">예전에 남극에 근무하신 의사선생님의 절묘한 작품~~~~~크릴 새우 맛있게 먹고 발사~!!! </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/245F63505381571A0F\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"700\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"img_8278_copy_re.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"700\"  id=\"A_245F63505381571A0F9172\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">빙하 한조각~ 수천년전의 공기방울이 보이시나요? </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24167B505381571C0A\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"사진 039.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_24167B505381571C0A73F3\"/></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">세종기지에서는 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">빙하로 팥빙수를 만들어주신답니다아~!! </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/210286505381571F1C\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"사진 041.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_210286505381571F1C19C8\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">어딜 찍어도 작품~!!! 요것도&nbsp;한 대원분의 작품~!!</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/243B58505381572014\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"872\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"아델리펭귄.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"872\"  id=\"A_243B58505381572014AA0D\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">남극의 고래뼈~!! </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/220F67505381572009\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" height=\"505\" style=\"WIDTH: 720px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 505px; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"550\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"세종기지 근처에 있는 고래뼈.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_220F67505381572009A9F3\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">펭귄마을 방문했어요~!! </SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24515D4D5381572737\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"펭귄마을에서 나.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_24515D4D5381572737204B\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">&nbsp;멋진 빙하들~ </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/27243038538159A012\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"DSC_0180.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_27243038538159A012C76F\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22657638538159A209\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"DSC_0404.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_22657638538159A2099793\"/></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">눈이 참 시원하게도 내렸죠?</SPAN><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2405B338538159A004\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"845\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"크기변환_snow.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"845\"  id=\"A_2405B338538159A004C207\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">자랑스러운 세종기지 -photo by ssangkal</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2456C238538159A10B\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"South Korean station.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2456C238538159A10B2BCC\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">덥지만 선생님들이랑 아이들 모두 화이팅~!!! </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2704293553815B521E\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"641\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"크기변환_snowman.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"641\"  id=\"A_2704293553815B521E2E19\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></P>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
